fixture bell_rings_on_every_hit_at_ten_stacks
doc BUILD.md s8 Stacking math, "A 10%-chance Lantern at 10 stacks procs every hit"; Bell of the Vigil, "10% chance on hit to ring, stunning everything in 120 u; stacks add chance" (docs/adr/0015: a sure chance draws no roll). Each hit of the chain rings once and stuns the dummy; the finisher's poise break staggers it.
room test/dummy
option votive_bell_of_the_vigil 10
frames 30
input
  0 attack
  7 attack
  14 attack
end
expect
  at 2 event.hit=1 procs=1 proc.bell_of_the_vigil=1 event.stun=1 enemy.state=stun
  at 9 event.hit=1 procs=1 event.stun=1 enemy.state=stun
  at 17 event.hit=1 procs=1 event.stun=1 enemy.state=stagger
end
